WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.243 line:85%
I helped show that our night sky has more planets than stars!

2
00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:07.733 line:85%
I'm Kepler, a space telescope.

3
00:00:07.823 --> 00:00:10.437 line:85%
I launched in 2009.

4
00:00:10.527 --> 00:00:17.239 line:85%
Every day, I stared at the same patch of sky, watching 150,000 stars.

5
00:00:17.329 --> 00:00:23.594 line:85%
When a planet crossed in front of its star, the starlight dipped a tiny bit, and I noticed!

6
00:00:23.684 --> 00:00:28.230 line:85%
Because of that, I found more than 2,600 planets.

7
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.944 line:85%
In 2018, I ran out of fuel.

8
00:00:32.034 --> 00:00:35.322 line:85%
Do you think one of those planets could be like Earth?
